        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108879845?u=eeb9306682180ab80521c80fd8f46609fe3c6770&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The output of the <code class=\"notranslate\">update-browser-releases</code> script is:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">@mdn/browser-compat-data@7.2.4 update-browser-releases<br>\ntsx scripts/update-browser-releases/index.ts --all</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Updates for Edge for Desktop</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>New status for edge 144: current, previously beta.</li>\n<li>New release date for edge 144: 2026-01-16, previously 2026-01-15.</li>\n<li>New status for edge 143: retired, previously current.</li>\n<li>New status for edge 145: beta, previously nightly.</li>\n<li>New status for edge 146: nightly, previously planned.RangeError: Invalid time value</li>\n<li>New release detected for edge: Version 147 as a planned release.</li>\n</ul>",
